<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>The death hint from the deathhints 2DA will be shown the next time the death screen is shown. The death hint is
cleared after the death screen is hidden. If this is not called before showing the death screen, no hint will be
displayed.
</p>
